WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:06.107
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> It’s really hot. Would you like a drink? Or an ice cream?

2
00:00:06.517 --> 00:00:09.599
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> Yes, good idea. Let’s go to the café.

3
00:00:13.924 --> 00:00:15.847
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> What kind of ice cream do you want?

4
00:00:15.894 --> 00:00:18.238
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> Er, a Magnum, please.

5
00:00:22.551 --> 00:00:25.012
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> Here you are. One Magnum.

6
00:00:25.399 --> 00:00:26.185
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> Thanks, Dave.

7
00:00:26.911 --> 00:00:27.837
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> Where do you live?

8
00:00:28.236 --> 00:00:31.740
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> Very near here, in Park Road. And you?

9
00:00:32.068 --> 00:00:34.999
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> I live quite near, in Queen’s Road.

10
00:00:35.608 --> 00:00:37.062
What do you do, Becca?

11
00:00:37.214 --> 00:00:38.327
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> I’m a journalist.

12
00:00:38.515 --> 00:00:43.555
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> Really? How interesting! Do you work for a newspaper?

13
00:00:43.660 --> 00:00:47.165
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> No, for TV. What about you?

14
00:00:47.247 --> 00:00:49.744
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> I’m a teacher. I’m on holiday now.

15
00:00:49.884 --> 00:00:53.272
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> Me too. Oh! My ice cream.

16
00:00:53.330 --> 00:00:57.222
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> Dolly! Bad dog! I’m really sorry.

17
00:00:57.479 --> 00:00:58.441
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> That’s OK.

18
00:00:58.523 --> 00:01:00.046
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> Do you want another ice cream?

19
00:01:00.210 --> 00:01:01.511
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> No, thanks.

20
00:01:01.582 --> 00:01:05.415
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> Are you sure? I’m really sorry.

21
00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:10.513
Look, let’s have lunch one day. Are you free on Saturday?

22
00:01:10.900 --> 00:01:16.116
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> Oh, well, OK then. Yeah. Thanks very much.